      "key": "buyback_02_20"
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": "可是……",
      "act": 2,
      "key": "buyback_02_21"
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": "明明知道不对劲……",
      "act": 2,
      "key": "buyback_02_22"
    },
    {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": "却还是忍不住想再喝一点。",
